Let's start with ip link show.

53
00:03:20,095 --> 00:03:24,555
Let's flip over to the man page.

54
00:03:24,555 --> 00:03:29,380
Let's search for ip link show.

55
00:03:29,420 --> 00:03:33,570
It says display
device attributes.

56
00:03:33,570 --> 00:03:36,080
You've already created devices

57
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:39,290
and you want to show
