00:03:53,380 --> 00:03:56,450
If we look at the very top,

62
00:03:57,150 --> 00:04:00,290
well, that's the bottom.

63
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:08,200
Ip link show device and
then some options here.

64
00:04:10,790 --> 00:04:14,140
This gets a little more details.

65
00:04:15,140 --> 00:04:20,425
Getting back to the slides.

66
00:04:20,425 --> 00:04:23,570
We could just run
an ip link show.

