74
00:04:48,590 --> 00:04:52,370
How these options would
be run is you just put

75
00:04:52,370 --> 00:04:55,730
these before like IP.

76
00:04:55,730 --> 00:05:00,330
Here's your options and
then link and show.

77
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:06,260
IP link set. This is to change

78
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:12,905
the state or the configuration
of an RD existing device.

79
00:05:12,905 --> 00:05:17,165
We can go over to the man page,

