84
00:05:38,110 --> 00:05:41,360
Some of the key ones are

85
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:48,690
address there and then setting
the device up or down.

86
00:05:49,270 --> 00:05:54,810
Going back, showing those
would be IP link set.

87
00:05:54,940 --> 00:06:00,875
Specify the device, so we
say device or dev eth0,

88
00:06:00,875 --> 00:06:03,110
and then we're going to apply

89
00:06:03,110 --> 00:06:05,210
the option of the address and

90
00:06:05,210 --> 00:06:09,725
then what value
we're setting it to.

91
00:06:09,725 --> 00:06:12,110
Another example would be to

92
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:16,385
