into the up state.

93
00:06:16,385 --> 00:06:20,000
We can see IP link set,

94
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:24,755
device would be dev
eth0 into the up state.

95
00:06:24,755 --> 00:06:30,320
Or we could have said
IP link set dev eth0,

96
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:36,600
address and then provide
the address to it.

97
00:06:38,050 --> 00:06:40,640
That's set.

98
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:43,805
Now IP link add,

99
00:06:43,805 --> 00:06:46,470
let's see what that does.

100
